}, "class.336c3b472273": {"type": "shape", "color": "#e6e6e6", "text": "`space/kanban`\n**StageMarks**\n---\n+ moved_into: Stage | None\n---\n+ StageMarks(ticket: Ticket)\n+ latest_in(stage: Stage): str | None\n+ enter(stage: Stage): Ticket\n+ mark(mark: str, stage: Stage): Ticket\n+ place(stage: Stage, mark: str): Ticket", "kind": "rect", "size": "small", "textAlign": "left", "x": 7874.0, "y": 29568.0, "w": 340.0, "h": 234.0}, "class.a75891132432": {"type": "shape", "color": "#e6e6e6", "text": "`space/kanban`\n**BacklogItem**\n---\n+ path: Path\n+ path_from_project: str\n+ title: str\n+ column: Column\n+ ticket: str\n+ text: str\n+ last_activity: str\n---\n+ BacklogItem(path: Path, board: Board)\n+ load(backlog_item: str, project: Path | str): BacklogItem\n+ create(title: str, text: str, project: Path | str): BacklogItem\n+ from_ticket(ticket: Ticket): BacklogItem\n+ write_if_missing(title: str): None\n+ start(scope: str, path: str): Ticket\n+ move_next(): Ticket\n+ move_previous(): BacklogItem", "kind": "rect", "size": "small", "textAlign": "left", "x": 9994.0, "y": 28518.0, "w": 520.0, "h": 423.0}, "class.0872f2a123a4": {"type": "shape", "color": "#e6e6e6", "text": "`space/kanban`\n**FidelityProgress**\n---\n+ ticket: Ticket\n+ fidelity: FidelityGuidance\n+ stage: Stage\n+ practice: PracticeGuidance\n+ is_enabled: bool\n+ done_actions: list[str]\n+ remaining_actions: list[str]\n+ next_action: str\n+ commands: dict[str, str]\n+ allowed_actions: list[str]\n+ has_violations: bool\n+ is_done: bool\n+ state: str\n+ action_states: ActionStates\n+ report_file: str\n+ latest_report: ReportFile | None\n+ violation_count: int\n---\n+ FidelityProgress(fidelity: FidelityGuidance, stage: Stage, done_actions: list[str], has_violations: bool, ticket: Ticket)\n+ from_log(fidelity: FidelityGuidance, stage: Stage, entries: list[LogLine], ticket: Ticket): FidelityProgress\n+ load(ticket: str, fidelity: str, project: Path | str): FidelityProgress\n+ command(action: str): str\n+ finish_review(): FidelityProgress\n+ report(): Report\n+ help(): Help\n+ files(): dict[str, list[FileEntry]]\n+ with_violations(): FidelityProgress", "kind": "rect", "size": "small", "textAlign": "left", "x": 8864.0, "y": 30578.0, "w": 960.0, "h": 654.0}, "class.f2c75cefed5f": {"type": "shape", "color": "#e6e6e6", "text": "`space/kanban`\n**StageWork**\n---\n+ stage: Stage\n+ progress: list[FidelityProgress]\n+ action_states: ActionStates\n+ has_violations: bool\n+ violation_count: int\n+ commands: dict[str, str]\n+ allowed_actions: list[str]\n---\n+ StageWork(ticket: Ticket, stage: Stage, progress: list[FidelityProgress])", "kind": "rect", "size": "small", "textAlign": "left", "x": 7774.0, "y": 30158.0, "w": 600.0, "h": 276.0}, "class.52eaa2b5e60c": {"type": "shape", "color": "#e6e6e6", "text": "`space/kanban`\n**Report**\n---\n+ path: str\n+ text: str\n+ << composition >> rules: list[ReportRule]\n+ has_saved_graph: bool\n+ is_out_of_date: bool\n+ violation_count: int\n---\n+ Report(path: str, text: str, rules: list[ReportRule] | None, has_saved_graph: bool, is_out_of_date: bool)\n+ from_reports(folder: str, reports: list[Report]): Report", "kind": "rect", "size": "small", "textAlign": "left", "x": 9284.0, "y": 31798.0, "w": 840.0, "h": 276.0}, "class.8c77a45da7b7": {"type": "shape", "color": "#e6e6e6", "text": "`space/kanban`\n**ReportFile**\n---\n+ file: Path\n+ << association >> report: ValidationReport\n+ text: str\n+ has_result: bool\n+ is_judged_failing: bool\n---\n+ ReportFile(report: ValidationReport)\n+ from_fidelity(fidelity: FidelityGuidance): ReportFile | None\n+ report(): Report", "kind": "rect", "size": "small", "textAlign": "left", "x": 8544.0, "y": 31378.0, "w": 500.0, "h": 276.0}, "class.ea998df3e9a9": {"type": "shape", "color": "#e6e6e6", "text": "`space/kanban`\n**BoardPractices**\n---\n+ catalogued: list[CatalogPractice]\n---\n+ BoardPractices(catalogued: list[CatalogPractice])\n+ of(kind: type): CatalogPractice\n+ works_through(kind: type): bool\n+